==English==

===Etymology===
Surname of the heroine Juliet's family in Shakespeare's ''Romeo and Juliet''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{figuratively}} A member or citizen of the family, party, or country of the wife in a [[Romeo and Juliet couple]].

